  "load_order": [
    {
      "phase": "CoreKey",
      "source": "0xcc85dc",
      "facts": "BeginUpdate(unit); inherited input attrs/apps; NeoPro eight secondary bits, raw block groups/Stores/timers/expiry; raw eight key masks ascending Add/RemoveByNumber with direct callbacks; EndUpdate(unit); ApplicationObjectRefresh then Application2ObjectRefresh. Raw masks do not imply final reference order."
