      "phase": "CoreNeo",
      "source": "0xccb180",
      "facts": "Inherited CoreKey complete; Patch gate sets ScenesEnabled; GetControlAppGroup atccb3fd (app202 create-enabled group), GetSceneCommands atccb403, GetKeyValues atccb40a, then KeysChanged. Scene getter/key load run regardless of Patch."
    },
    {
      "phase": "CoreNeoPro",
      "source": "0xced154",
      "facts": "Inherited CBusNeo wrapper complete; KeyDisable, Corridor, Join refs and related scalar flags load after eight key command load. They cannot affect earlier Scene claim collision decisions as future facts."
    },
    {
      "phase": "ST7Multisensor",
      "source": "0xcf4890",
      "facts": "Inherited CoreNeoPro complete; target/margin load before LoadLightLevelBanks atcf4a40; PEC refs/maintenance/broadcast follow; LoadOccupancyKeys atcf4b90; occupancy enable, power fail, potentiometers. Bank clamps can rewrite Stores after key templates were derived; do not derive key templates anew from post-bank Stores."
    },
    {
      "phase": "SurfaceMultisensor",
      "source": "0x1217764",
      "facts": "Inherited ST7 complete; surface power/target/margin/bank-group overlays load next."
    },
    {
      "phase": "FreshDirector",
      "facts": "M8 InitialiseFunctionCombos occurs before hooks and decision handler; Scene25 absent from SENLLA lists becomes unlocked16 and zeros. Scene24 present survives. Fresh binding application/group controls render only; no explicit click callbacks. Surface scalar/bank fresh normalization happens later; target>200 clamp preserves original logical marginpercent."
    }
  ],
